menu "Smart-Air AI Inference"

    config SA_AI_TENSOR_ARENA_SIZE
        int "TFLite Micro tensor arena size (bytes)"
        default 24576
        range 8192 131072
        help
            Static working buffer shared sequentially by both ensemble
            member models (one model's AllocateTensors()/Invoke() fully
            completes before the other's starts, so this only needs to fit
            the LARGER of the two, not both at once).

            24576 (24KB) is a rough starting estimate for this model size
            (~4.5K params, largest INT8 activation ~32 channels x 24
            length) -- NOT a measured value (no ESP32-S3 hardware was
            available to benchmark when this was written, see
            ai/README.md "Benchmark HOWTO"). If `idf.py build` or a boot-time
            log shows `AllocateTensors failed`, increase this value.

endmenu
